                                <p><p>Hussain Hussain Hussain<br />
Ye farshe aza sab ke liye hai zahra ki dua sab ke liye hai..(2)<br />
Ye farshe aza<br />
Ye farshe buqa<br />
Ye farshe aza farshe buqa karbobala hai<br />
Ye khaq e najaf khak e haram khaak e shifa hai<br />
Ye noor e khuda qibla numa arshe khuda hai<br />
Jalne na do nafrat ke diye pyari hawao<br />
Hai ek khuda ek nabi sab ko batao<br />
Aur kaho<br />
Aur kaho<br />
