<p>Labbaik hussain labbaik<br />
Ye farshe aza sabke liye hai.....</p>

<p>Duniya me saf e matam e shabbir bichao..(2)<br />
Khwahish hai ye zahra ki ise bhul na jao<br />
Paigham e hussain ibne ali sabko sunao<br />
Insan shanasi hai aza khano me aao<br />
Ye amn ka paigham hai dunaya ko sunao</p>

<p>Shabbir ne sikhlayi hai insaan shanasi<br />
Insa ki hidayat ke liye jaan luta di<br />
Hai majlis e shabbir isi nukhte ki aadi<br />
Allah ki dharti pe na tum khoon bahao<br />
Chahat ke shajar phool muhabbat ke khilao</p>

<p>Haan...<br />
Insa ki nigheban azadari e shabbir<br />
Momin ka hai imaan azadari e shabbir<br />
Rishto ki hai pehchan azadari e shabbir<br />
Is dar se muhabbat ko suno aur sunao<br />
Abbas e alamdar ke parcham ko uthao</p>

<p>Ye karbobala kya hai ye maqtal nahi maqtab<br />
Is maqtab e aali ki mudarris hui zainab<br />
Jis bibi ne mazbut kiya aur bhi mazhab<br />
Is bibi ke khutbo ko nisabo me padhao<br />
In phulon ko guldan e aqeedat me sajao</p>

<p>Haan...<br />
Gar shauk e ziarat hai azakhane me aao<br />
Gar amn ki chahat hai azakhane me aao<br />
Dehshat se jo nafrat hai azakhane me aao<br />
Jannat ki zururat hai to is gham ko manao<br />
Duniya se sitamgaro ke fitne ko mitao</p>

<p>Ye aun o mohammad ali Akbar ka hai matam<br />
Abbas sakina ali asghar ka hai matam<br />
Ye zainab o kulsum ka haider ka hai matam<br />
Wo dekho safiraan e aza aate hai aao<br />
Aye sarwar o rehan chalo nauha sunao</p>
